[al:新概念英语（三）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:A Very Dear Cat]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:00.44]Lesson 19 | 第19课
[00:02.41]A very dear cat | 一只贵重的宝贝猫
[00:10.28]Why was Rastus 'very dear' in more ways than one? | 为什么说拉斯特斯在多方面都是“贵重的”？
[00:16.88]Kidnappers are rarely interested in animals, but they recently took considerable interest in Mrs. Eleanor Ramsay's cat. | 绑架者很少对动物感兴趣，但最近他们却对埃莉诺·拉姆齐太太的猫产生了极大的兴趣。
[00:26.36]Mrs. Eleanor Ramsay, a very wealthy old lady, has shared a flat with her cat, Rastus, for a great many years. | 埃莉诺·拉姆齐太太是一个非常富有的老妇人，多年来一直同她的猫拉斯特斯一起住在一套公寓里。
[00:36.36]Rastus leads an orderly life. | 拉斯特斯生活很有规律。
[00:38.82]He usually takes a short walk in the evenings and is always home by seven o'clock. | 它傍晚常出去散步一会儿，并且总在7点钟之前回来。
[00:45.58]One evening, however he failed to arrive. | 可是有一天晚上，它没有回来。
[00:49.80]Mrs. Ramsay got very worried. | 拉姆齐太太急坏了。
[00:52.41]She looked everywhere for him but could not find him. | 她四处寻找，也没有找到。
[00:57.20]Three days after Rastus' disappearance, Mrs. Ramsay received an anonymous letter. | 拉斯特斯失踪3天后，拉姆齐太太收到一封匿名信。
[01:04.34]The writer stated that Rastus was in safe hands and would be returned immediately if Mrs. Ramsay paid a ransom of ￡1, 000. | 写信人声称拉斯特斯安然无恙，只要拉姆齐太太支付1000英镑赎金，便立刻将它送还。
[01:15.73]Mrs.Ramsay was instructed to place the money in a cardboard box and to leave it outside her door. | 信中要求拉姆齐太太把钱放进一只纸盒，置于门外。
[01:22.62]At first, she decided to go to the police, | 起初，她打算去报告警察，
[01:26.66]but fearing that she would never see Rastus again--the letter had made that quite clear--she changed her mind. | 但又担心再也见不到拉斯特斯了——信上说得相当明白——于是便改变了主意。
[01:36.31]She withdrew ￡1000 from her bank and followed the kidnapper's instructions. | 她从银行取出1000英镑，按照绑架者的要求做了。
[01:41.97]The next morning, the box had disappeared but Mrs.Ramsay was sure that the kidnapper would keep his word. | 第二天早晨，装钱的盒子不见了，但拉姆齐太太确信绑架者是会守约的。
[01:50.27]Sure enough, Rastus arrived punctually at seven o'clock that evening. | 果然，当天晚上7点整，拉斯特斯准时回来了。
[01:56.58]He looked very well, though he was rather thirsty, for he drank half a bottle of milk. | 它看上去气色很好，只是相当口渴，因为它喝了半瓶牛奶。
[02:04.04]The police were astounded when Mrs. Ramsay told them what she had done. | 拉姆齐太太把自己做的事告诉了警察，警察听后大为吃惊。
[02:09.64]She explained that Rastus was very dear to her. | 她解释说，拉斯特斯对她来说非常珍贵。
[02:13.38]Considering the amount she paid, he was dear in more ways than one! | 想到她所付出的那笔钱，它的珍贵可就非同一般了！
